## 4. Expected Product Impact

By deploying Cosmic Bonds as an organic entry point, AstroLive can transform its unit economics and growth velocity:

| Growth Metric | Crisis-Driven Marketplace (Current) | Social Synastry Engine (Cosmic Bonds) |
|---|---|---|
| **Viral Coefficient (K-factor)** | $K \approx 0.05$ (Almost no sharing) | $K \ge 1.15$ (Viral sharing loops) |
| **CAC Model** | Paid Performance Ads (Meta, Google) | Organic Social Referral & Word-of-Mouth |
| **Retention (Day 30)** | < 8% | 22% - 28% (Driven by widgets & social checks) |
| **Engagement Loop** | Transactional, Crisis-Based | Social comparison, Daily rituals |
| **Monetization Window** | Immediate wallet billing (High Friction) | Freemium AI & Social -> Marketplace handoff |

### 4.1 Retentive Loops & Habit Formation
* **Social Currency:** Displaying birth charts and compatibility acts as a badge of identity. When users share their "Cosmic Identity Card" to social feeds, they invite validation, driving friends to generate their own cards.
* **Empathetic Triggering:** Pinging a user when their partner is undergoing a stressful planetary aspect (e.g., Mars transiting their moon) prompts empathetic communication, creating a strong habit loop.

